WeightXReps Rust client

Usage: wxrust [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list     List workout dates, optionally with details or summaries
  show     Show a workout log for a date (defaults to the most recent)
  fetch    Download workouts from the server into the local cache
  table    Display personal-record progression as a table
  heatmap  Display a calendar heatmap of workout intensity
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -c, --credentials <FILE>    Path to credentials.txt (email on line 1, password on line 2)
  -a, --force-authentication  Ignore the cached auth token and log in again
      --no-network            Do not connect to the server; use local cache only
      --no-cache              Do not read workouts from the local cache
      --no-cache-write        Do not write fetched workouts to the local cache
      --color <COLOR>         When to color output: auto, always, never [default: auto]
  -v, --verbose               Enable debug output
  -h, --help                  Print help
